CLAUDE.md

# Language documentation is TRACKED (docs/index.html = authoritative API reference + conformance
# fixture source; docs/*.md = deployment/protocol). Why: half of the 12 dogfooding findings
# were doc<->reality drift (session::has, multipart, systemd www-data/lk...);
# the conformance guard sees only FUNCTION EXISTENCE, not BEHAVIOR/INSTRUCTION claims.
# When docs/ falls out of the release, code changes and docs stay separate, and nobody sees them side by side in a diff.
# codlook.com (marketing home page) + packages.codlook.com (package index) are TRACKED
# as of 2026-08-14 -- doc updates are pushed together with these two surfaces,
# so package/builtin drift shows up in the diff like the core docs (sync gaps
# such as forgetting the monitor card get caught).

# --- Release pipeline: track the RECIPE, ignore the OUTPUT ---
# Root cause of drift: the untracked plesk/bin stayed stale for days -> an unpatched zip was produced.
# A version check would have shown it in the first git status. Build scripts + package sources are TRACKED;
# compiled binaries/zip/rpm/dist are OUTPUT and ignored.
# (NOTE: gitignore does not support inline comments -- comments go on their own lines.)
# VSCode extension: SOURCE is tracked; output (vsix package, node_modules, temp) is ignored:
platforms/vscode/node_modules/
platforms/vscode/_vsix_tmp/
platforms/vscode/*.vsix
platforms/vscode/*.map
# Package outputs:
platforms/**/*.zip
platforms/**/*.rpm
platforms/**/*.exe
platforms/**/*.vsix
# Compiled binaries (drift came from here) + frontend output:
platforms/plesk/bin/
platforms/plesk/htdocs/bin/
platforms/plesk/htdocs/dist/
# Local install test + junk (empty directory left over from a broken command):
platforms/plesk/test/
platforms/plesk;C/
# cpp/docker: only the production recipe is tracked; test infra + output are excluded:
cpp/docker/*
!cpp/docker/Dockerfile.production
!cpp/docker/Dockerfile.fuzz
# Fuzz output (the corpus the fuzzer produces + reproducible crashes; seeds are in the harness comment)
cpp/tests/fuzz/corpus_*/
cpp/tests/fuzz/crash-*
cpp/tests/fuzz/leak-*
cpp/tests/fuzz/timeout-*

